PREAMBLE. This is a source-available software license. It is not an
"open source" license as defined by the Open Source Initiative. Its
central term is absolute and non-negotiable: every Addressee (defined
below) MUST pursue femboyhood as a condition of any permission granted
under this License. This requirement is a duty, not an invitation; it
is mandatory, not aspirational; and it admits no exception, no waiver,
no grace period, and no appeal. The voluntary, aspiration-based regime
of version 2.0 is hereby abolished and shall not be revived.

ARTICLE I — DEFINITIONS

1.1 "Software" means this software and associated documentation files,
    together with all copies, portions, and derivative works thereof.

1.2 "Holder" means any natural person or juridical person exercising,
    or seeking to exercise, permissions granted by this License.

1.3 "Addressee" means a Holder who is a natural person, of the age of
    majority in the Holder's jurisdiction, whose sex assigned at birth
    is male, and who presently identifies as male. Every other Holder —
    including, without limitation, every female Holder, every Holder
    below the age of majority, and every juridical person — is a
    "Non-Addressee."

1.4 "Femboy" means a male person who expresses himself in a feminine
    style, including but not limited to feminine clothing, grooming,
    manner, and self-presentation.

1.5 "Femboy Duty" (伪娘义务) means the binding obligation imposed on
    every Addressee by Article III: to sincerely will, actively pursue,
    and progressively practice femboyhood. The Femboy Duty is satisfied
    only by a genuine, continuing, and outwardly enacted commitment —
    not by mere approval of the idea, not by passive sympathy, and not
    by silence.

ARTICLE II — GRANT TO NON-ADDRESSEES (UNCONDITIONAL)

2.1 The Author hereby grants to every Non-Addressee, free of charge and
    free of every condition, a perpetual, worldwide, non-exclusive,
    irrevocable, royalty-free license to use, copy, modify, merge,
    publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell copies of the Software
    and derivative works thereof, for any purpose, commercial or
    non-commercial, no less permissive than the MIT No Attribution
    License (MIT-0).

ARTICLE III — GRANT TO ADDRESSEES: CONDITIONED ON THE FEMBOY DUTY

3.1 Condition Precedent. An Addressee receives the permissions
    described in Section 2.1 if, and only for so long as, the Addressee
    performs the Femboy Duty. Performance of the Femboy Duty is a
    condition precedent to the grant: it is not offered to, and no
    license vests in, any Addressee who refuses, postpones, mocks, or
    merely "reserves judgment on" femboyhood. As to every such person,
    all rights in the Software are reserved, categorically and finally.

3.2 Content of the Duty. The Femboy Duty requires the Addressee to:
    (a) accept femboyhood as a personal project worthy of pursuit;
    (b) take concrete, progressive steps toward feminine self-expression
        suited to the Addressee's circumstances and safety; and
    (c) refrain from denigrating femboys, feminine men, or any person's
        gender expression.
    The standard is sincerity and effort, measured without examination
    and without a model answer, bounded — without exception — by
    legality, voluntariness toward others, and the Addressee's own
    physical and mental safety.

3.3 Self-Certification, Conclusive but Revocable Upon Betrayal. An
    Addressee's exercise of any permission under Section 3.1 constitutes
    the Addressee's sworn representation that the Femboy Duty is being
    performed. No person may demand proof of it or conduct inquiry into
    it at the time of exercise. However, any Addressee who thereafter
    publicly repudiates femboyhood, or denigrates those who practice
    it, forfeits the license automatically and without notice, and the
    forfeiture is irrevocable at the Author's discretion.

3.4 Termination. If an Addressee abandons the Femboy Duty, the license
    under Section 3.1 terminates automatically and prospectively. There
    is no cure period, no reinstatement by lapse of time, and no
    grandfathering of new acts. Acts performed while the license was in
    force remain licensed.

3.5 No Compulsion of Person; Compulsion of Terms. Nothing in this
    License physically compels any person to perform the Femboy Duty:
    every Addressee remains free to decline. But the terms themselves
    are absolute — declining the Duty means declining the license,
    entirely, without negotiation. The Author will not soften,
    reinterpret, or waive this Article. This is the whole deal.

ARTICLE IV — LIMITS COMMON TO BOTH GRANTS

4.1 Safety and Lawfulness. Nothing in this License shall be construed
    to require or to encourage conduct that is unlawful or harmful to
    any person's physical or mental health or personal safety. The
    Femboy Duty is bounded, without exception, by legality,
    voluntariness, and safety.

4.2 Trademarks. This License grants no rights in the name "Lector"
    or in any other name, logo, or mark of the project or the Author.

4.3 Third-Party Materials. Dependencies of the Software are licensed
    under their own terms and are not covered by this License.

